# Django dev/test databases. `DJANGO_TEST_SQLITE=true` points NAME at a file
# inside BASE_DIR, so running the suite writes one next to settings.py; seven
# of them were committed. Schema is rebuilt from migrations, so nothing here
# is a source of truth.
*.sqlite3

